{"title": "Godswill", "pageid": 30491, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Godswill", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Godswill</b> is a passive feature that boots the user's ability to channel their god's power.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain an additional use of <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/30px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/40px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity_Charge\" title=\"Channel Divinity Charge\">Channel Divinity Charge</a>. Once used, it is restored upon taking a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_the_Devout\" title=\"Amulet of the Devout\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/45/Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Amulet_of_the_devout_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_the_Devout\" title=\"Amulet of the Devout\">Amulet of the Devout</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Contrary to the in-game description, the additional <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/30px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/40px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Channel_Divinity_Charges_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity_Charge\" title=\"Channel Divinity Charge\">Channel Divinity Charge</a> granted by Godswill restores on a <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">short rest</a>. However if the extra charge is expended and the amulet is unequipped, the extra charge does not reappear if re-equipped before a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">long rest</a>; at this point it cannot be restored with a short rest.</li>\n<li>The additional Channel Divinity Charge does not incur the amulet's once-per-rest cooldown if spent on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Destructive_Wrath\" title=\"Destructive Wrath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp/20px-Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp/30px-Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp/40px-Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Destructive Wrath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp/20px-Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Destructive_Wrath_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Destructive_Wrath\" title=\"Destructive Wrath\">Destructive Wrath</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guided_Strike\" title=\"Guided Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Guided_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp/30px-Guided_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Guided_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guided Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp/20px-Guided_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Guided_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guided_Strike\" title=\"Guided Strike\">Guided Strike</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Touch_of_Death\" title=\"Touch of Death\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp/20px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp/30px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp/40px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Touch of Death\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp/20px-Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Wasteland_Wanderer_Poison_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Touch_of_Death\" title=\"Touch of Death\">Touch of Death</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/War_God%27s_Blessing\" title=\"War God's Blessing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/20px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/30px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/40px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"War God's Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp/20px-War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/War_God%27s_Blessing_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/War_God%27s_Blessing\" title=\"War God's Blessing\">War God's Blessing</a>.  If spent in this manner, simply unequipping and reequipping the amulet restores the Channel Divinity Charge.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201226\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1852/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16656/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7265/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1045471/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.807      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   47.807      1 -total\n 26.96%   12.890      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 22.16%   10.592      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 20.35%    9.727      4 Template:SmSAI\n 20.09%    9.604      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 19.35%    9.252      2 Template:R\n 15.56%    7.439      1 Template:Item_icon\n 14.87%    7.111      4 Template:Icon_link\n 13.75%    6.573      4 Template:Icon_text\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30491-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201226 and revision id 390629. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}